  <h1>Bona Fide Nitro Coffee and Tea</h1>

  <h2>Who We Are</h2>
  <p>Bona Fide Nitro Coffee and Tea Brewing Company was founded in 2015. We make Craft Draft nitro coffee and nitro tea, with a mission built on sustainability and innovation.</p>

  <h2>Core Values</h2>
  <p>Sustainability and innovation are central to our mission.</p>

  <h2>What We Do</h2>
  <p>We brew nitro coffee and nitro tea and pack it in kegs and Bag in Box, and support customers with equipment and implementation. See <a href="/products/">our products</a> and <a href="/kegerators/">equipment</a>.</p>

  <h2>Where Do We Fit</h2>
  <p>Bona Fide serves offices and food service. See <a href="/howtobuy/">how to buy</a>.</p>

  <h2>Our Team</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>John Goerke — Founder/CEO</li>
    <li>Spencer Weiner — Sales Director</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Our Facilities</h2>
  <p>Our certified organic brewing facility is in Ventura, CA, with a capacity of 10,000+ kegs per month.</p>
